// Learning content for every topic. All items are original, written for this prototype.
// Each topic has: a prerequisite check, a concept explanation, a worked example, a common
// misconception, a conventional-vs-faster method comparison, a short refresher, and three
// practice items (easy, medium, hard) used by the Concept, Quick Win, Solve Faster and
// evidence-check activities. Practice items are separate from the diagnostic mocks.

